# Licensed BADA 3 runtime-derived ROC/ROD REPORT and ENFORCE gate.
00:00:00.00>ECHO TEST INFO === BADA 3 VERTICAL ENVELOPE GATE ===
00:00:00.05>ECHO TEST INFO VS inputs are feet per minute and all bounds come from the active model.
00:00:00.10>ECHO TEST EXPECT REPORT retains excessive rates while ENFORCE limits signed rates independently.
00:00:00.15>PLUGIN LOAD PYBADATEM
00:00:00.20>PLUGIN LOAD RESEARCHRECORDER
00:00:00.25>PERFMODEL BADA3
00:00:00.30>DT 0.05
00:00:00.35>DATE 11,8,2026,12:00:00
00:00:01.00>CRE B3CR,A320,41.30,2.10,90,FL200,250
00:00:01.05>CRE B3CE,A320,41.32,2.10,90,FL200,250
00:00:01.10>CRE B3DR,A320,41.34,2.10,90,FL200,250
00:00:01.15>CRE B3DE,A320,41.36,2.10,90,FL200,250
00:00:01.20>DYNAMICS B3CR KINEMATIC
00:00:01.21>DYNAMICS B3CE KINEMATIC
00:00:01.22>DYNAMICS B3DR KINEMATIC
00:00:01.23>DYNAMICS B3DE KINEMATIC
00:00:01.30>ALT B3CR FL300 500
00:00:01.31>ALT B3CE FL300 500
00:00:01.32>ALT B3DR FL100 -500
00:00:01.33>ALT B3DE FL100 -500
00:00:01.40>ENVELOPECHECKS B3CR CUSTOM ROC_MAX
00:00:01.41>ENVELOPECHECKS B3CE CUSTOM ROC_MAX
00:00:01.42>ENVELOPECHECKS B3DR CUSTOM ROD_MAX
00:00:01.43>ENVELOPECHECKS B3DE CUSTOM ROD_MAX
00:00:01.50>ENVELOPE B3CR REPORT
00:00:01.51>ENVELOPE B3CE ENFORCE
00:00:01.52>ENVELOPE B3DR REPORT
00:00:01.53>ENVELOPE B3DE ENFORCE
00:00:02.00>RECORDRESEARCH START pybada3-envelope-vertical.csv
00:00:03.00>ECHO TEST ACTION Commanding excessive positive and negative vertical rates.
00:00:03.10>VS B3CR 10000
00:00:03.20>VS B3CE 10000
00:00:03.30>VS B3DR -10000
00:00:03.40>VS B3DE -10000
00:00:12.00>PERFSTATUS ALL
00:00:13.00>RECORDRESEARCH STOP
00:00:13.10>ECHO TEST INFO Run validate_bada3_vertical.py on output/pybada3-envelope-vertical.csv.
00:00:13.20>ECHO TEST EXPECT REPORT aircraft are infeasible and ENFORCE aircraft remain within runtime ROCD bounds.
00:00:14.00>HOLD
